#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of ibus"
msgstr "Instalação do ibus"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "First, install the Unicode Character Database as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, instale a base de dados de caracteres Unicode como o(a) usuário(a)"
" &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p               /usr/share/unicode/ucd &amp;&amp;\n"
"unzip -o ../UCD.zip -d /usr/share/unicode/ucd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p               /usr/share/unicode/ucd &amp;&amp;\n"
"unzip -o ../UCD.zip -d /usr/share/unicode/ucd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix an issue with deprecated schema entries:"
msgstr "Corrija um problema com entradas de esquema obsoletas:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:131
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's@/desktop/ibus@/org/freedesktop/ibus@g' \\\n"
"    -i data/dconf/org.freedesktop.ibus.gschema.xml</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's@/desktop/ibus@/org/freedesktop/ibus@g' \\\n"
"    -i data/dconf/org.freedesktop.ibus.gschema.xml</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend='gtk-doc'/> is not installed, remove the references to it:"
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend='gtk-doc'/> não estiver instalado, remova as referências a "
"ele:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:139
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>if ! [ -e /usr/bin/gtkdocize ]; then\n"
"  sed '/docs/d;/GTK_DOC/d' -i Makefile.am configure.ac\n"
"fi</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>if ! [ -e /usr/bin/gtkdocize ]; then\n"
"  sed '/docs/d;/GTK_DOC/d' -i Makefile.am configure.ac\n"
"fi</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>ibus</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>ibus</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:148
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>SAVE_DIST_FILES=1 NOCONFIGURE=1 ./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc      \\\n"
"            --disable-python2      \\\n"
"            --disable-appindicator \\\n"
"            --disable-emoji-dict   \\\n"
"            --disable-gtk2         \\\n"
"            --disable-systemd-services &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>SAVE_DIST_FILES=1 NOCONFIGURE=1 ./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc      \\\n"
"            --disable-python2      \\\n"
"            --disable-appindicator \\\n"
"            --disable-emoji-dict   \\\n"
"            --disable-gtk2         \\\n"
"            --disable-systemd-services &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>SAVE_DIST_FILES=1 NOCONFIGURE=1 ./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc      \\\n"
"            --disable-python2      \\\n"
"            --disable-appindicator \\\n"
"            --disable-gtk2         \\\n"
"            --disable-emoji-dict   &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>SAVE_DIST_FILES=1 NOCONFIGURE=1 ./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc      \\\n"
"            --disable-python2      \\\n"
"            --disable-appindicator \\\n"
"            --disable-gtk2         \\\n"
"            --disable-emoji-dict   &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make -k check</command>.  The test "
"named ibus-compose fails because it uses some locales not installed in LFS."
"  The xkb-latin-layouts test is also known to fail on some systems."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make -k check</command>. O teste "
"chamado ibus-compose falha porque ele usa alguns locais não instalados no "
"LFS. O teste xkb-latin-layouts também é conhecido por falhar em alguns "
"sistemas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:181
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-appindicator</parameter>: This switch disables use of "
"libdbusmenu. Omit if you installed the optional dependency."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-appindicator</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita usar a "
"libdbusmenu. Omita se você instalou a dependência opcional."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-emoji-dict</parameter>: This switch disables the use of"
" emoticon dictionaries. Omit if you installed the optional package."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-emoji-dict</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o uso de "
"dicionários de emoticons. Omita se você instalou o pacote opcional."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-gtk2</parameter>: This switch removes the dependency on"
" <application>GTK+-2</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-gtk2</parameter>: Essa chave remove a dependência do "
"<application>GTK+-2</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-gtk4</option>: This switch disables building the "
"<application>GTK 4</application> immodule. Use it if you don't want to "
"install <application>GTK 4</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-gtk4</option>: Essa chave desabilita construir o immodule "
"do <application>GTK 4</application>. Use-a se você não quiser instalar o "
"<application>GTK 4</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-wayland</option>: This switch enables building the "
"<application>Wayland</application> support programs.  It's automatically "
"enabled if both <xref linkend='libxkbcommon'/> and <xref linkend='wayland'/>"
" are installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-wayland</option>: Essa chave habilita construir os "
"programas de suporte do <application>Wayland</application>. Ela é habilitada"
" automaticamente se <xref linkend='libxkbcommon'/> e <xref "
"linkend='wayland'/> estiverem instalados."

#.  GCC security policy: "Libraries like libvtv and the sanitizers
#.            are intended to be used in diagnostic cases and not intended for
#.            use in sensitive environments."  In my build it also causes
#.            "compose/sequences-little-endian" bail out with a sanitizer
#.            warning and the package to FTBFS.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>NOCONFIGURE=1</envar>: Prevent <command>autogen.sh</command> from "
"running the generated <command>configure</command> script.  We'll run the "
"script manually instead of relying on <command>autogen.sh</command> to run "
"it, because <command>autogen.sh</command> would set "
"<option>-fsanitize=address -fsanitize=leak</option> in <envar>CFLAGS</envar>"
" running <command>configure</command>, but those compiler options are not "
"suitable for productive use and they may also cause a build failure."
msgstr ""
"<envar>NOCONFIGURE=1</envar>: Impede que <command>autogen.sh</command> "
"execute o conjunto de comandos sequenciais <command>configure</command> "
"gerado. Nós executaremos o conjunto de comandos sequenciais manualmente em "
"vez de depender do <command>autogen.sh</command> para executá-lo, porque "
"<command>autogen.sh</command> configuraria <option>-fsanitize=address "
"-fsanitize=leak</option> em <envar>CFLAGS</envar> executando "
"<command>configure</command>, mas essas opções do compilador não são "
"adequadas para uso produtivo e também podem causar uma falha da construção."

#.  This is needed because we do not have the Emoji dictionary.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>SAVE_DIST_FILES=1</envar>: This environment variable makes the "
"<command>autogen.sh</command> script save some pre-generated header files "
"instead of overwriting them when it is run. This prevents build failures "
"when generating <filename>ibusemojigen.h</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<envar>SAVE_DIST_FILES=1</envar>: Essa variável de ambiente faz com que o "
"conjunto de comandos sequenciais <command>autogen.sh</command> salve alguns "
"arquivos de cabeçalho pré gerados em vez de sobrescrevê-los quando for "
"executado. Isso evita falhas de construção ao gerar "
"<filename>ibusemojigen.h</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Ibus"
msgstr "Configurando Ibus"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:256
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If GTK+-3 is installed and <option>--disable-gtk3</option> is not used, the "
"ibus IM module for GTK+-3 will be installed.  As the &root; user, update a "
"cache file of GTK+-3 so the GTK-based applications can find the newly "
"installed IM module and use ibus as an input method:"
msgstr ""
"Se o GTK+-3 estiver instalado e <option>--disable-gtk3</option> não for "
"usado, o módulo IM do ibus para GTK+-3 será instalado. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;, atualize um arquivo de cache do GTK+-3, de forma que os aplicativos "
"baseados em GTK possam encontrar o módulo IM recém-instalado e usar o ibus "
"como um método de entrada:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:262
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-3.0 --update-cache</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-3.0 --update-cache</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/ibus.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The command above updates the cache file for GTK+-3. GTK-4 does not require "
"a cache file for IM modules."
msgstr ""
"O comando acima atualiza o arquivo de cache para GTK+-3. O GTK-4 não exige "
"um arquivo de cache para módulos IM."

